      "content": "therapy is just gonna take more money and more time and i'll just keep being the person who drains everything from them. i can't help but think that if i wasn't even in the equation anymore, they could finally move on and be happy. it almost feels like the most responsible thing i could do is just stop being a problem for them. like, if the cause of the pain is gone, the pain goes away too. doesn't that make sense?",
